    "ability": {
     "value": "Attacks inflict, at random, chill, smoldering, or deal 2 extra piercing damage. Once every 2 turns, a random enemy is transported into a \"mind realm\" for 2 turns. Inside the mind realm, there is a 5/3/4/4 corruptor enemy whose attacks inflict sickness. While in the mind realm, the enemy character cannot attack anything but the corruptor, nor can its ability affect anything outside the mind realm. If the corruptor is defeated the character within the mind realm is immediately ejected, and no more characters can enter the mind realm. If Kalecgos is defeated first he enters stasis, and any enemy can enter/exit the mind realm at will until the corruptor is defeated as well.",
     "method": "triage",
     "confidence": "sure"
    },
